[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25741.99, "timestamp": "07:09:01", "text": "围栏爆破器。是的，我们正在加热"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25746.83, "timestamp": "07:09:06", "text": "能同时解决两个问题的装置。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25750.15, "timestamp": "07:09:10", "text": "是的。还有什么呢？战斗没问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25753.43, "timestamp": "07:09:13", "text": "因为我们有很多武器，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25756.548, "timestamp": "07:09:16", "text": "需要去发现和找到。我添加了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25760.468, "timestamp": "07:09:20", "text": "多把弓。如果制作一把弓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25767.59, "timestamp": "07:09:27", "text": "弓箭之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25770.468, "timestamp": "07:09:30", "text": "呃，还有纸箭头之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25771.788, "timestamp": "07:09:31", "text": "使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25774.628, "timestamp": "07:09:34", "text": "那支箭。不同的箭头会有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25776.948, "timestamp": "07:09:36", "text": "不同的效果，其中也包括"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25782.59, "timestamp": "07:09:42", "text": "现在有了RPG模组。所以，这就是问题所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25785.99, "timestamp": "07:09:45", "text": "出色地。就像……呃，它会是……呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25790.868, "timestamp": "07:09:50", "text": "现在很难找到RPG箭矢了。所以，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25794.468, "timestamp": "07:09:54", "text": "我当时想，好吧，也许我就跟着走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25796.75, "timestamp": "07:09:56", "text": "和"}]